7592186268807 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "e3a390e1-866c-520b-b61b-4f91163c49d1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186269176 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186268645 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186269176 #edb/ref 1069 "q-138132" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186269176 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186269176 #edb/ref 1071 "The maximum value of the quadratic form $Q(x)=-2{x}_{1}^{2}+{x}_{2}^{2}-{x}_{3}^{2}+4{x}_{1}{x}_{2},$ when $‖x‖=1,$ is equal to $2.$ Which of the following is a vector $x$ at which the maximum is attained?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186269176 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "cc5eba78-8576-573c-99ab-7374b3ba103b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186269176 #edb/ref 1074 "Let $A$ be the matrix corresponding to our quadratic form. Recall that: \n\n- The maximum value of $Q(x),$ when $‖x‖=1,$ is equal to the largest eigenvalue of $A:$\n\n$$\nmax\\{Q(x)\\,|\\,‖x‖=1\\}={\\lambda }_{\\text{max}}\n$$\n\n \nThe maximum is attained on the corresponding unit eigenvector ${u}_{\\text{max}}.$\n\n- The minimum value of $Q(x),$ when $‖x‖=1,$ is equal to the smallest eigenvalue of $A:$\n\n$$\nmin\\{Q(x)\\,|\\,‖x‖=1\\}={\\lambda }_{\\text{min}}\n$$\n\n \nThe minimum is attained on the corresponding unit eigenvector ${u}_{\\text{min}}.$\n\nFirst, we write down the matrix of our quadratic form:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nNow, we need the unit eigenvector that corresponds to the eigenvalue ${\\lambda }_{\\text{max}}=2:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-2I & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}-2\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-2I)x=0$ gives the eigenvector $v=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.$ \n\nFinally, dividing $v$ by its norm $‖v‖=\\sqrt{5},$ we get \n\n$$\n{u}_{\\text{max}}=\\frac{v}{‖v‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186273122 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{2}{3e}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186273122 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186273122 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "56618797-f80d-5f20-b613-2bd682039a09" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186273931 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{3e}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186273931 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186273931 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "b2b0deb2-c7a1-5be3-9f75-1d7fb46518a4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274265 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{1}{6e}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274265 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274265 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "d6b36024-c655-582a-8646-93a494970ea8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274446 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{3}{e}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274446 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274446 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e909e18b-5208-57ac-8c56-7d8b1563313b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274479 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{2}{e}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274479 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274479 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ece08ba3-5b3b-5fff-a9e4-89fc6df72547" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274892 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186273122 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274892 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186273931 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274892 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186274265 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274892 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186274446 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274892 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186274479 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274892 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274892 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274892 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186273122 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186274892 #edb/ref 1